<title>USA: PriCellular sets 5-for-4 stock split.</title>
<headline>PriCellular sets 5-for-4 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>PriCellular Corp said its board set a five-for-four stock split in the form of a 25 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable October 18 to shareholders of record on October 7.</p>
<p>The cellular phone systems company has about 30.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
